  "description": "She was forced to marry. Now, her husband wants a divorce. Leah retreats to a secluded villa to regroup—only to be saved from danger by a mysterious leopard. But the wild creature is no ordinary beast; he’s Januk, a shape-shifting imperial prince, and taming him might be the start of something wild.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
